ds on it, see `a2e-projects/src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts` L147-174 `TASK_FIELD_IDS`).\n\nPrimitives:\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/hooks/useQuickCapture.ts` L35-37 — `createOneRecord` for `CoreObjectNameSingular.Task`; L63-83 dispatch.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/hooks/useOpenCreateActivityDrawer.ts` L18-115 — creates an activity (`Task` or `Note`) + junction targets and opens it in the side panel (L106-110). Entry: `useCreateActivityForTargetRecord.ts` L16-34.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/hooks/useCreateActivityInDB.ts` L22-121 (editor path).\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/hooks/useCalendarTaskQuickCreate.ts` L11-58 — `useCreateOneRecord({ objectNameSingular: CoreObjectNameSingular.Task, recordGqlFields:{id,title,dueAt,status} })` (L18-21).\n\nUI triggers:\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/tasks/components/TaskGroupsContent.tsx` L63-70 `title={t\\`New task\\`}`.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/notes/components/NotesCardContent.tsx` L57-64 `title={t\\`New note\\`}`.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarTaskQuickCreateDialog.tsx` L121-151 (`t\\`New task\\``, L143/150).\n- Generic record-index: `RecordTableHeaderLabelIdentifierCellPlusButton.tsx` L28-58; `RecordTableNoRecordGroupAddNew.tsx` L120-126 (`t\\`Add New\\``); `RecordListAddNew.tsx` L100-108 (`t\\`Add new\\``); `RecordCalendarAddNew.tsx` L90-114 (`t\\`Create record\\``); `RecordIndexEmptyState.tsx` L38.\n\nApp-side create:\n- `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-projects/src/front-components/create-task-command.front-component.tsx` L14-47 — `createTasks` mutation → open `task` record page.\n- `.../command-menu-items/create-task.command-menu-item.ts` L11-17.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Project — a2e-projects app object\n\nObject: **`project`** — app-owned by a2e-projects (NOT standard).\n- `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-projects/src/objects/project.object.ts` L27 `nameSing