ateCalendarEvent.ts`).\n- Targets: `useCreateCalendarEventTargets.ts` L18-52.\n\nUI triggers:\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarEventComposer.tsx` L240/245 `t\\`New event\\``.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/AgendaLanding.tsx` L14, L89 `t\\`New event\\``.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarDayTimeGrid.tsx` L211/229 `t\\`Create event\\``.\n- Generic `RecordCalendarAddNew.tsx` L90-114.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Invoice — a2e-accounting\n\nObject: **`invoice`** — app-owned by a2e-accounting.\n- `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-accounting/src/objects/invoice.object.ts` L25 `nameSingular: 'invoice'`.\n- Universal id: `OBJECT_IDS.invoice = 'b11a0100-0000-4000-8000-000000000000'` (`.../constants/universal-identifiers.ts` L23).\n\nFinding: **no host create primitive and no implemented app create command.** The constants `FRONT_COMPONENT_IDS.invoiceBuilder` (L119) and `COMMAND_MENU_ITEM_IDS.buildInvoice` (L131) exist but have **no corresponding files** anywhere in `src` (grep for `invoiceBuilder`/`buildInvoice` returns only the constants). The only create-capable paths today:\n- Generic record path once installed: `useCreateOneRecord({ objectNameSingular: 'invoice' })`, or the record-index `+` after navigating to the invoices view.\n- Nav/view: `.../navigation-menu-items/invoices.navigation-menu-item.ts` L11-19 → app view `VIEW_IDS.invoices` (`.../views/invoices.view.ts`).\n- Invoice numbering/ledger logic (not UI create): `.../logic-functions/stamp-invoice-number.ts`, `.../handlers/numbering-handler.ts` L37-39; relation `quoteConvertedInvoice` (`universal-identifiers.ts` L56).\n\nThe app's host-side detection signal is `invoice` metadata: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/home-dashboard/components/PendingBilanWidget.tsx` L19 `BILAN_INVOICE_OBJECT_NAME_SINGULAR = 'invoice'`, L28-35 metadata-probe gate.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Expense — a2e-accounting\n\nObject: there is **no `expense` object**. Expense