leUpload().uploadFile` (L55, L106-114) then `useCreateOneRecord({ objectNameSingular: CoreObjectNameSingular.Attachment })` L65-67, `createAttachment({ name, folderId, sourceApp, file:[...] })` L116-121.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/drive/hooks/useDriveActions.ts` L22-106 — `createOneRecord({ objectNameSingular: 'driveFolder' })` L25-27; `createDriveFolder({name,parentId})` L60-69.\n- Picker primitive: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/file-upload/hooks/useFileUpload.ts` L4-12 (`openFileUpload({multiple, onUpload})`, via `FileUploadContext`).\n- Shared direct upload: `useDirectFileUpload` (imported at `useDriveUploadQueue.ts` L7).\n\nUI triggers:\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/pages/drive/DrivePage.tsx` L210 `openFileUpload`, L211-218 `useDriveUploadQueue`, L423-432 `handleUploadFiles`/`handleOpenUploadPicker`, L498-512 `handleCreateFolder`, L628 `DriveUploadDropZone`, L670-683 `ArchiveLanding`.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/drive/components/DriveToolbar.tsx` L231-247 `t\\`Upload\\`` / `t\\`New folder\\``.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/drive/components/ArchiveLanding.tsx` L118-130 `t\\`New folder\\`` / `t\\`Upload\\``.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/drive/components/DriveUploadDropZone.tsx` L40-70.\n- Generic files-field upload: `.../record-field/ui/meta-types/input/components/FilesFieldInput.tsx` L27 and `hooks/useOpenFilesFieldInput.tsx` L18.\n\n---\n\n## Install-gate hooks and constants (all `useIs*ApplicationInstalled`)\n\nExactly three such hooks exist in `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/`:\n\n| Hook | Path | Universal identifier passed |\n|---|---|---|\n| `useIsDocumentApplicationInstalled` | `modules/quick-capture/hooks/useIsDocumentApplicationInstalled.ts` L6-16 | `19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48` |\n| `useIsDriveApplicationInstalled` | `modules/drive/hooks/useIsDriveApplicationInstalled.ts` L6-20 | `b11cd01f-75de-4acd-8e67-0e9c484fde02` |\n| `useIsA2eLinksApplicationInstalled` | `modules/a2e-links/hooks/useIsA2eLinksApplicationInstalled.ts` L6-20 | `895bb7aa-3ae3-400f-9dfa-72116f0021e2` |\n\nBacking predicates/constants:\n- `modules/quick-capture/utils/newPageDocument.ts` L4-5 id, L17-22 `isDocumentApplicationInstalled`.\n- `modules/drive/utils/isDriveApplicationInstalled.ts` L4-5 id, L11-16 predicate.\n- `modules/a2e-links/utils/isA2eLinksApplicationInstalled.ts` L3-8 predicate; constant `modules/a2e-links/constants/A2eLinksApplicationUniversalIdentifier.ts` L4-5.\n\nAll three read `applicationsSelector` (`modules/applications/states/applicationsSelector`) and map `application.universalIdentifier`.\n\nGeneric suite-level detection:\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/constants/A2eSuiteApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.ts` L5-20 — all 7 app ids (documents, accounting, projects, chat, drive, crm, links).\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/hooks/useA2eSuiteApplications.ts` L15-57 — `{ installedApplications, availableApplications }` via `findManyApplications` + `useMarketplaceApps`.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/pages/onboarding/InstallApps.tsx` L40 filters `A2E_SUITE_APPLICATION_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIERS`.\n\n**There is no `useIsAccountingApplicationInstalled` and no `useIsProjectsApplicationInstalled`.** Accounting presence is probed through object metadata (`invoice`) in `PendingBilanWidget.tsx` L19-35; projects has no host install gate at all.\n\nRelated gated action example (not an install hook, but the gating pattern): `modules/a2e-links/components/LinkToRecordButton.tsx` L34-37 + `utils/shouldShowA2eLinkAction.ts` L8-14.\n\n---\n\n## Object `nameSingular` summary\n\n| User-facing type | `nameSingular` | Owner | App universal identifier |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| page / Bureau document | `document` | a2e-documents (`OBJECT_IDS.document = c31a0100-…`) | `19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48` |\n| task | `task` | standard Twenty core (a2e-projects adds fields) | — |\n| project | `project` | a2e-projects (`OBJECT_IDS.project = c31b0200-…`) | `4f759655-84f8