      "result": "<task id=\"ses_f06a43798ffebtQKgnr3lr2QTD\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI have completed a thorough investigation. Here is the full map of the command menu (Cmd+K) system.\n\n---\n\n# Executive summary\n\nIn this version of Twenty, **the built-in/default command-menu items are not hardcoded in `packages/twenty-front`**. They are **server-side metadata** owned by the Twenty Standard Application, seeded into each workspace, and synced to the client through the metadata store. The frontend `command-menu-item` module is a **filter / group / render / execute** layer over that metadata.\n\nThere is **no** `useDefaultCommandMenuItems`, `commandMenuItemsDefault`, `useCommandMenuItems`, or `getDefaultCommandMenuItems` in the frontend. The default-items engine is:\n\n- Server: `STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEMS` constant + `buildStandardFlatCommandMenuItemMaps`\n- Client: `commandMenuItemsSelector` (metadata-store atom selector)\n\nA second, much smaller set of entries is still hardcoded in React (Quick capture, New page, Templates, Filter workflows, theme/link app actions) and appended to the side-panel list.\n\n---\n\n# 1. How built-in/default items are defined and registered\n\n## 1a. The default-items source of truth (server)\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/workspace-manager/twenty-standard-application/constants/standard-command-menu-item.constant.ts`\n\n- Line 8: `export const STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEMS = { ... } as const;`\n- Each entry has: `universalIdentifier`, `label`, `icon`, `isPinned`, `position`, `shortLabel`, `availabilityType`, `conditionalAvailabilityExpression`, `availabilityObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier`, `frontComponentUniversalIdentifier`, `engineComponentKey`, `hotKeys`, optional `payload`.\n- Representative entries:\n  - `navigateToNextRecord` (line 9) / `navigateToPreviousRecord` (line 29) — `RECORD_SELECTION`, gated by `pageType == \"RECORD_PAGE\" and not isInSidePanel ...`\n  - `createNewRecord` (line 49) — `GLOBAL_OBJECT_CONTEXT`, `EngineComponentKey.CREATE_NEW_RECORD`\n  - `deleteRecords` (74), `restoreRecords` (96), `destroyRecords` (118), favorites, export, merge, import, workflow commands (`activateWorkflow` ~484, etc.)\n  - `searchRecords` (~line 831), `searchRecordsFallback` (852) — `FALLBACK` availability\n  - `askAi` (870), `viewPreviousAiChats` (887), `replyToEmailThread` (911)\n  - Settings navigation items: `goToSettings` (1046), `goToSettingsExperience` (1065), `goToSettingsAccounts` (1087), `goToSettingsGeneral` (1153), `goToSettingsObjects` (1175), `goToSettingsMembers` (1197), `goToSettingsRoles` (1219), `goToSettingsDomains` (1241), `goToSettingsBilling` (1263), `goToSettingsApiWebhooks` (1285), `goToSettingsApplications` (1307), `goToSettingsAI` (1326), `goToSettingsSecurity` (1345), `goToSettingsAdminPanel` (1367), `goToSettingsUpdates` (1390)\n  - `composeEmailToPerson` (1412), `composeEmailToCompany` (1432), `composeEmailToOpportunity` (1452), `duplicateMessageList` (1472)\n\nExample (line 1046):\n```\ngoToSettings: {\n  universalIdentifier: 'ef9aba44-0068-453e-930a-f8c182af18ee',\n  label: i18nLabel(msg({ message: `Go to Settings`, context: 'commandMenuItem.label' })),\n  icon: 'IconSettings',\n  isPinned: false,\n  position: 47,\n  shortLabel: i18nLabel(msg({ message: `Settings`, ... })),\n  availabilityType: CommandMenuItemAvailabilityType.GLOBAL,\n  conditionalAvailabilityExpression: null,\n  ...\n  engineComponentKey: EngineComponentKey.NAVIGATION,\n  hotKeys: ['G', 'S'],\n  payload: { path: '/settings/profile' },\n},\n```\n\n## 1b. Per-object navigation items (\"Go to {objectLabelPlural}\")\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/flat-command-menu-item/utils/build-object-navigation-universal-flat-command-menu-item.util.ts`\n- Lines 17–26: interpolated labels `NAVIGATION_INTERPOLATED_LABEL = \"Go to {objectLabelPlural}\"`, icon placeholder, short-label placeholder\n- Lines 44–68: `buildNavigationConditionalAvailabilityExpression` builds `targetObjectReadPermissions.<nameSingular>` plus feature-flag gates (`IS_EMAIL_GROUP_ENABLED`, `IS_WORKFLOW_CORE_INDEX_PAGE_ENABLED`)\n- Lines 70–127: returns the universal flat item with `engineComponentKey: EngineComponentKey.NAVIGATION`, `navigationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier`, hotkey from object shortcut (`['G', shortcut]`), `isSystemSideEffect: true`\n\n## 1c. Assembly / registration into the workspace\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/workspace-manager/twenty-standard-application/utils/command-menu-item/build-standard-flat-command-menu-item-maps.util.ts`\n- Line 15–17: `STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEM_NAMES = Object.keys(STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEMS)`\n- Lines 35–51: loop → `createStandardCommandMenuItemFlatMetadata`\n- Lines 53–58: `activeObjects` = all active object metadata, sorted by `seedCompareObjectMetadataForNavigationPosition`\n- Lines 69–87: for each active object, `buildObjectNavigationFlatCommandMenuItem` appended after the standard items\n\n`.../utils/command-menu-item/create-standard-command-menu-item-flat-metadata.util.ts`\n- Lines 10–88: maps a `STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEMS` definition to a `FlatCommandMenuItem`; resolves `availabilityObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier` → id (lines 32–48); assigns `applicationId = twentyStandardApplicationId`, `isActive: true`, `isSystemSideEffect: false`.\n\nWired in `.../utils/twenty-standard-application-all-flat-entity-maps.constant.ts`:\n- Line 12 import, line 248 `const flatCommandMenuItemMaps = buildStandardFlatCommandMenuItemMaps({...})`, line 282 registered in the all-maps object.\n\n## 1d. Item shape / type\n\nGraphQL fragment source:\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/graphql/fragments/commandMenuItemFragment.ts` (lines 3–34)\n\nGenerated type:\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/generated-metadata/graphql.ts` lines 7817–7820:\n```\nCommandMenuItemFieldsFragment = {\n  id, universalIdentifier?, applicationId?, workflowVersionId?, frontComponentId?,\n  engineComponentKey, label, icon?, shortLabel?, position, isPinned, hotKeys?,\n  conditionalAvailabilityExpression?, availabilityType, availabilityObjectMetadataId?,\n  navigationTargetObjectMetadataId?, pageLayoutId?, isActive,\n  frontComponent?: { id, name, isHeadless } | null,\n  payload?: ObjectMetadataCommandMenuItemPayload | PathCommandMenuItemPayload | null\n}\n```\nAlias: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/metadata-store/types/FlatCommandMenuItem.ts` (line 3: `export type FlatCommandMenuItem = CommandMenuItemFieldsFragment;`).\n\n## 1e. Client-side retrieval and assembly\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/states/commandMenuItemsSelector.ts`\n- Lines 8–35: reads `metadataStoreState` for `commandMenuItems` + `frontComponents`, filters `item.isActive`, attaches resolved `frontComponent`.\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/contexts/CommandMenuContextProviderContent.tsx`\n- Lines 44–68: the main **assembly/filter** pipeline:\n  1. `doesCommandMenuItemMatchObjectMetadataId(currentObjectMetadataItemId)`\n  2. `doesCommandMenuItemMatchPageType(commandMenuContextApi.pageType)`\n  3. `doesCommandMenuItemMatchSelectionState(hasSelectedRecords)`\n  4. `doesCommandMenuItemMatchPageLayoutId(effectivePageLayoutId)`\n  5. `evaluateConditionalAvailabilityExpression(item.conditionalAvailabilityExpression, commandMenuContextApi)`\n  6. sort by `position`\n- Lines 49–51: in preview mode, uses `commandMenuItemsDraft ?? commandMenuItems`.\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/metadata-store/hooks/useLoadStaleMetadataEntities.ts` lines 215–227 load `commandMenuItems` from the `findManyCommandMenuItems` query.\n\n## 1f. Other server registration paths (not the standard constant)\n\n- Workflow manual-trigger items are created/updated/deleted at runtime by the workflow service: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/modules/workflow/workflow-trigger/workspace-services/workflow-trigger.workspace-service.ts`\n  - `createOrUpdateCommandMenuItem` (lines 472–524), `deleteCommandMenuItem` (526–548), `resolveManualTriggerAvailability` (427–470), engine key `TRIGGER_WORKFLOW_VERSION`.\n- Seed workflow item: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/workspace-manager/standard-objects-prefill-data/utils/prefill-workflow-command-menu-items.util.ts` (`QUICK_LEAD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEM_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIER`, lines 12–106).\n- Seed front-component items: `.../prefill-front-component-command-menu-items.util.ts` (definitions from `prefill-front-component-definitions.util.ts`, `getSeedFrontComponentCommandMenuItemDefinitions` lines 97–150).\n- App-manifest items: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/application/frontComponentManifestType.ts` lines 4–14 (`CommandMenuItemManifest`), converted server-side at `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/core-modules/application/application-manifest/services/compute-application-manifest-all-universal-flat-entity-maps.service.ts` lines 647–666. This is the SDK/app path for an app to ship new command-menu entries.\n\n---\n\n# 2. Existing \"Create\" command-menu items\n\n- **\"Create new {objectLabelSingular}\"** is the canonical create item:\n  - Constant: `standard-command-menu-item.constant.ts` lines 49–73 (`createNewRecord`), `isPinned: true`, `availabilityType: GLOBAL_OBJECT_CONTEXT`, expression `pageType == \"INDEX_PAGE\" and objectPermissions.canUpdateObjectRecords and ... objectMetadataItem.isUICreatable ...`, `EngineComponentKey.CREATE_NEW_RECORD`.\n  - Execution component mapping: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/constants/EngineComponentKeyHeadlessComponentMap.tsx` line 63 → `<CreateNewIndexRecordNoSelectionRecordCommand />`.\n  - Implementation: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/record/no-selection/components/CreateNewIndexRecordNoSelectionRecordCommand.tsx`.\n  - Other create-ish engine items: `CREATE_NEW_VIEW` (constant line 343; component `CreateNewViewNoSelectionRecordCommand.tsx`), `COMPOSE_CAMPAIGN`/`composeCampaignPinned` \"Create new Campaign\" (constant line 966).\n- **No** literal \"Create record\", \"Create note\", \"Create event\" command-menu default items. \"Create note\"/\"Create task\" exist only as:\n  - Quick-capture targets: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/utils/quickCapture.ts` — `QuickCaptureTargetId = 'note' | 'task' | 'income'` (line 7), `QUICK_CAPTURE_TARGET_IDS` (9–13), `buildQuickCaptureCreatePlan` (51–65). Rendered by `QuickCaptureCommand.tsx`, gated/searched via `useQuickCaptureCommand.ts`.\n  - Related-record side-panel actions (not the Cmd+K engine): `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/hooks/useCreateActivityRelatedRecordAction.ts` lines 27–36 (`id: 'create-task' | 'create-note'`, labels `t\\`Create task\\`` / `t\\`Create note\\``), used by `modules/side-panel/pages/create-related-record/`.\n  - \"Create event\" lives in the calendar/side-panel composer, not the command menu (e.g. `modules/calendar/components/CalendarDayTimeGrid.tsx:211`, `modules/side-panel/pages/compose-calendar-event/...`).\n\n---\n\n# 3. Grouping, titles/labels, and item fields\n\n- **Grouping logic**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/utils/groupCommandMenuItems.ts` (lines 3–18) splits items into exactly `{ pinned, other }` by `item.isPinned`. There is **no `availableOn` field** anywhere in the repo (searched, zero matches).\n- **Group headings** are hardcoded Lingui strings in the UI:\n  - `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/display/components/SidePanelCommandMenuItemDisplayPage.tsx`\n    - `t\\`Pinned\\`` line 155, `t\\`Other\\`` line 167, `t\\`Fallback\\`` line 199\n    - Lines 61–80 split `pinned` / unpinned / `FALLBACK` (`CommandMenuItemAvailabilityType.FALLBACK`)\n  - `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/edit/components/SidePanelCommandMenuItemEditPage.tsx` — `t\\`Pinned\\`` line 215, `t\\`Other\\`` line 262\n- **Container types**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/types/CommandMenuItemContainerType.ts` (lines 1–9): `CommandMenuList`, `IndexPageHeader`, `IndexPageDropdown`, `ShowPageHeader`, `StandalonePageHeader`, `CommandMenuShowPageDropdown`, `SidePanelFooter`, `WidgetHeader`.\n- **Context shape**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/contexts/CommandMenuContext.ts` lines 7–13 (`displayType`, `containerType`, `commandMenuItems`, `commandMenuContextApi`, `isInPreviewMode`).\n- **Availability types**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/types/CommandMenuItemAvailabilityType.ts` lines 1–6: `GLOBAL`, `GLOBAL_OBJECT_CONTEXT`, `RECORD_SELECTION`, `FALLBACK`.\n- **Field-level label interpolation** (why labels can contain placeholders): `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/display/utils/interpolateCommandMenuItemFields.ts` (lines 13–27) and `getCommandMenuItemPlaceholderValues.ts` (lines 10–22).\n- **Match filters**: `doesCommandMenuItemMatchObjectMetadataId.ts` (4–7), `doesCommandMenuItemMatchPageType.ts` (17–20), `doesCommandMenuItemMatchPageLayoutId.ts` (4–6), `doesCommandMenuItemMatchSelectionState.ts` (6–9).\n- **Conditional-expression evaluation**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/utils/command-menu-items/evaluateConditionalAvailabilityExpression.ts` (lines 6–21, expr-eval based, fails closed) and `conditionalAvailabilityParser.ts`. Context fields are defined in `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/types/CommandMenuContextApi.ts` (lines 5–24).\n\n---\n\n# 4. Install-gating / object-metadata gating\n\nThere is currently **no A2E-app-gated command-menu engine item**. Gating in the metadata-driven engine is done via `availabilityObjectMetadataId`, `pageLayoutId`, and `conditionalAvailabilityExpression`. Existing patterns you can reuse:\n\n**Object-metadata gating (engine items)**\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/utils/doesCommandMenuItemMatchObjectMetadataId.ts` (lines 4–7): `!isDefined(item.availabilityObjectMetadataId) || item.availabilityObjectMetadataId === objectMetadataItemId`.\n- Server only generates per-object navigation for `isActive` objects (`build-standard-flat-command-menu-item-maps.util.ts` lines 53–58) and gates on `targetObjectReadPermissions.<nameSingular>` (`build-object-navigation-universal-flat-command-menu-item.util.ts` lines 44–68).\n- `NavigationEngineCommand.tsx` lines 16–23 bail out when `objectMetadataItem` is not defined.\n\n**App-install gating (front React commands)** — the pattern to copy for a Cmd+K entry gated on an A2E app:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/applications/states/applicationsSelector.ts` (lines 5–12): installed apps from metadata store `applications`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/hooks/useIsDocumentApplicationInstalled.ts` (lines 6–16) + `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/quick-capture/utils/newPageDocument.ts` (`A2E_DOCUMENTS_APPLICATION_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIER`, lines 4–5; `isDocumentApplicationInstalled`, 17–22; comment lines 7–10 explain gating on install rather than probing object metadata).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-links/hooks/useIsA2eLinksApplicationInstalled.ts` (6–20) + `utils/isA2eLinksApplicationInstalled.ts` (3–8).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/drive/hooks/useIsDriveApplicationInstalled.ts`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/constants/A2eSuiteApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.ts` (lines 5–20) and `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/hooks/useA2eSuiteApplications.ts` (15–57, resolves installed vs catalog).\n\n**Where such a gated command is wired into Cmd+K today**: `QuickCaptureCommand`, `NewPageCommand`, `TemplatesCommand`, and their hooks (`useNewPageCommand.ts` lines 15–19, `useQuickCaptureCommand.ts`, `useTemplatesCommand.ts`), all appended in the `Other` group by:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/display/components/SidePanelCommandMenuItemDisplayPage.tsx` lines 161–197.\nThis is the extension point for a new front-registered, install-gated entry (it is *not* a first-class engine item).\n\n---\n\n# 5. How items execute an action\n\nThere is **no `onCommandMenuClick` / `onCommandMenuSelect`** anywhere in the repo. The execution path is:\n\n1. **Click hook**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/hooks/useCommandMenuItemClick.ts`\n   - Classifies the item (lines 44–55): headless front component, engine command (`engineComponentKey` && no `frontComponentId`), or visual front component.\n   - Engine/headless → `mountCommand(...)` (lines 76–90) then returns.\n   - Visual front component → `openFrontComponentInSidePanel(...)` (lines 95–116).\n2. **Renderer** calls that hook: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/display/components/CommandMenuItemRenderer.tsx` lines 55–59 (button) and 102–103 (selectable); dispatches on `displayType` (lines 178–205).\n3. **Mounting**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/hooks/useMountCommand.ts` (lines 34–80) stores a `HeadlessCommandContextApi` keyed by item id in `headlessCommandContextApisState`.\n4. **Engine key → component map**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/constants/EngineComponentKeyHeadlessComponentMap.tsx` (lines 59–279) — `ENGINE_COMPONENT_KEY_COMPONENT_MAP: Record<EngineComponentKey, ReactNode>`. This is the action-carrying field: `item.engineComponentKey`.\n5. **Navigation action**: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/components/NavigationEngineCommand.tsx`\n   - Lines 16–33: `navigationTargetObjectMetadataId` → builds `AppPath.RecordIndexPage` via `getAppPath` and `navigate`.\n   - Lines 35–38: `payload` of type `PathCommandMenuItemPayload` → `navigate(payload.path)`.\n   - Payload check: `engine-command/utils/isPathCommandMenuItemPayload.ts`.\n\n**Engine component key union** (action member names):\n- Server source: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/command-menu-item/enums/engine-component-key.enum.ts` (lines 3–81) — e.g. `NAVIGATE_TO_NEXT_RECORD`, `CREATE_NEW_RECORD`, `DELETE_RECORDS`, `RESTORE_RECORDS`, `DESTROY_RECORDS`, `EXPORT_RECORDS`, `IMPORT_RECORDS`, `EDIT_RECORD_PAGE_LAYOUT`, `ACTIVATE_WORKFLOW`, `DEACTIVATE_WORKFLOW`, `TRIGGER_WORKFLOW_VERSION`, `SEARCH_RECORDS`, `SEARCH_RECORDS_FALLBACK`, `ASK_AI`, `NAVIGATION`, `FRONT_COMPONENT_RENDERER`, `COMPOSE_EMAIL`, `COMPOSE_CAMPAIGN`, `SEND_MESSAGE_CAMPAIGN`, `EMAIL_BLOCK_SETTINGS`, plus deprecated `GO_TO_*`.\n- Front generated enum: `~/generated-metadata/graphql` (`EngineComponentKey`), used in `EngineComponentKeyHeadlessComponentMap.tsx`.\n\n**Payload union** (item action payload): `ObjectMetadataCommandMenuItemPayload` | `PathCommandMenuItemPayload` (fragment lines 21–25; generated type line 7818–7819). Server DTO: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/command-menu-item/dtos/command-menu-item-payload.union.ts`.\n\n---\n\n# Additional notes relevant to your task\n\n- **Frontend item editing/registration** (position, pin, shortLabel) happens through GraphQL, not new item creation: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/edit/hooks/useSaveCommandMenuItemsDraft.ts` (lines 26–78, calls `UPDATE_COMMAND_MENU_ITEM`), draft state in `edit/states/commandMenuItemsDraftState.ts`, editable filter in `edit/hooks/useEditableCommandMenuItems.ts`. Mutations exist only for `update` and `reset` in the front (`graphql/mutations/updateCommandMenuItem.ts`, `resetCommandMenuItem.ts`); creation is server/SDK/CLI-driven.\n- **Server service** for item CRUD: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/command-menu-item/command-menu-item.service.ts` and entity `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/command-menu-item/entities/command-menu-item.entity.ts`.\n- **Standalone-page assembly** (different filter set, no page-type/selection filters) is in `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/components/StandalonePageCommandMenu.tsx` lines 104–124.\n- **Widget-header scoping** by application: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/page-layout/widgets/widget-card/utils/getWidgetHeaderCommandMenuItems.ts` (lines 9–48) matches items by `universalIdentifier` **and** `applicationId` — the closest existing \"only show my app's items\" pattern.\n\nIf your goal is to add a new Cmd+K entry, the two supported routes are: (a) an app-manifest `CommandMenuItemManifest` + front component (server-registered, synced through `commandMenuItemsSelector`), or (b) a React command component gated by an install hook and appended in `SidePanelCommandMenuItemDisplayPage` (the Quick capture / New page pattern).\n</task_result>\n</task>"
