        "prompt": "I'm working in the Twenty CRM monorepo (packages/twenty-front, React 19, Jotai, GraphQL). I need to find the **existing create primitives** for creating each of these record types, so a new Cmd+K \"Create…\" command-menu group can reuse them (no new mutation paths):\n\n- page (a2e-documents / Bureau document)\n- task (a2e-projects / standard `task`)\n- project (standard `project`? or a2e-projects app object)\n- event (calendar event — the host calendar app, object `calendarEvent`)\n- invoice (a2e-accounting)\n- expense (a2e-accounting)\n- file upload (a2e-drive)\n\nFor EACH, please find and report with exact file paths + line numbers:\n\n1. The existing create primitive — e.g. a hook like `useCreateOneRecord`, `useCreateOneRecord` variant, `useCreateOneObjectRecord`, `useCreateRecordAction`, a component action, a side-panel \"create\" page, `useCreateOneDocument`, or the navigation that opens a record-creation page/side-panel. Look in `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/` and app modules.\n2. How existing UI triggers creation (toolbar buttons, \"+ New\" buttons, side panel record create). Search for text like \"New record\", \"Create record\", \"createRecord\", \"Add record\", \"New task\", \"New note\", \"Nouvelle\".\n3. For the A2E apps (a2e-documents, a2e-projects, a2e-accounting, a2e-drive), search `packages/twenty-apps/internal/` and `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-*` for their object names, create actions/components, and the app universal identifiers.\n4. The exact object nameSingular for each type (e.g. `document`, `task`, `calendarEvent`, `invoice`, `expense`, and whatever a2e-projects/a2e-drive use).\n\nAlso identify existing install-gate hooks for these apps, e.g. `useIsA2eLinksApplicationInstalled` in `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-links/`. Search for `useIs*ApplicationInstalled` hooks across `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/` and report each.\n\nBe thorough with exact paths, line numbers, and short code excerpts. Do NOT write any code.",
